1
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:38,020
Attention, forces of the Arano Restoration!

2
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:42,180
I am Commodore Samuel Ostergaard of the Concord Navy.

3
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:43,980
You are surrounded by a battalion

4
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:47,300
of the Taurian Concordat's most decorated MechWarriors.

5
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,220
On behalf of our allies in the Aurigan Directorate,

6
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:55,220
I demand your immediate and unconditional surrender.

7
00:00:57,580 --> 00:01:00,020
But I know you won't stand down, Lady Arano.

8
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:02,820
You're The Sword of Restoration -

9
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:05,340
you have a reputation to uphold.

10
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,340
And that's good.

11
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:12,220
I wouldn't have it any other way.

12
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:16,620
I'm going to enjoy painting the ice red

13
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,100
with your blood.

